{"engine":"stitch","flow":"Responsive Folio3 Parking web app. Employees sign in with Google and are routed by their verified role to the employee or administrator workspace. Employees see their assignment, register a vehicle if needed, release or schedule a dedicated space, and eligible employees claim released spaces. Parking Administrators manage employee assignments, parking settings and roles, inspect weekly utilization and entry checks, and review retained audit history. Authentication validation, email delivery, weekly job execution, and trusted LPR/hardware commands are backend integrations, not separate user pages. All pages use the light visual treatment, shared role-specific header, consistent sample records, and responsive phone, tablet, and desktop layouts.","header":{"createdAt":"2026-10-12T12:56:44.713Z","inputsHash":"","kind":"design","producedBy":{"model":"gpt-6-luna","stage":"design"},"runId":"20261012-folio3-parking-app-introductio-0790","schemaVersion":1},"mapping":{"orphanScreens":[],"unmappedReqs":[]},"noScreen":[{"reason":"Claimable-space email delivery is a fixed-template background notification to eligible employees with a registered vehicle and no dedicated space. There is no separate email-settings or notification page required; the resulting availability is shown on S-5.","req":"REQ-14"},{"reason":"Keeping the existing permanent vehicle-sticker process unaffected and preserving a temporary claim when capacity is exceeded is integration behavior, not a user-facing page or control.","req":"REQ-15"},{"reason":"Trusted Folio3 LPR equipment authentication, unique authenticated request IDs/nonces, replay rejection, plate authorization and green-indicator activation are entrance integration and hardware behavior. S-12 displays recorded outcomes but is not an LPR control page.","req":"REQ-16"},{"reason":"Explicitly deactivating the green indicator and denying temporary-process entry on verification failure is a fail-safe integration command, not a user-facing page. S-12 displays the resulting denial and indicator outcome.","req":"REQ-17"},{"reason":"The actual Monday email job and filtering delivery to configured recipients with the Parking Administrator role are background behavior. S-10 provides the named recipient configuration and role visibility; there is no separate email-delivery page.","req":"REQ-21"}],"revision":1,"screens":[{"facts":{"buttons":[],"columns":[],"fields":[],"headings":[],"title":"Sign in to Folio3 Parking","ui":[]},"file":"src/pages/SignIn.tsx","frames":["ST-1"],"id":"S-1","reqs":["REQ-1","REQ-6"],"route":"/sign-in","size":"new","states":["Google callback verification fails or OAuth state is invalid: show a plain sign-in error, create no session, and expose no parking data.","The account is not an active Folio3 employee: explain that only active Folio3 employees can sign in; do not create a session."]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Give up my space today"],"columns":[],"fields":[],"headings":["Parking workspace","Ananya Rao","Scheduled releases","Eligible spaces status"],"title":"Parking workspace","ui":[]},"file":"src/pages/employee/ParkingHome.tsx","frames":["ST-2"],"id":"S-2","reqs":["REQ-2","REQ-6","REQ-8"],"route":"/parking","size":"new","states":["If the employee has no registered vehicle, keep the parking status visible but block release and claim actions and offer “Add or update a vehicle.”","Show a successful release or claim status from the current date without changing the page structure."]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Give up my space today"],"columns":[],"fields":[],"headings":["Ananya Rao"],"title":"Ananya Rao","ui":[]},"file":"src/pages/employee/ReleaseToday.tsx","frames":["ST-3"],"id":"S-3","reqs":["REQ-6","REQ-7","REQ-8"],"route":"/parking/release","size":"new","states":["After the single release action, show “Your space is released for today” and the configured time when it becomes claimable; do not offer a second release.","If already released or claimed for today, show the current result and no release action."]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Save release dates","Cancel release","Cannot cancel claimed release"],"columns":[],"fields":[],"headings":["Ananya Rao","Choose days you won’t need your space","Selected dates","Existing scheduled releases"],"title":"Choose days you won’t need your space","ui":[]},"file":"src/pages/employee/ScheduleReleases.tsx","frames":["ST-4"],"id":"S-4","reqs":["REQ-6","REQ-9","REQ-10"],"route":"/parking/schedule","size":"new","states":["Reject a selected date more than 30 days ahead and explain “Choose a date within the next 30 days.”","Show saved release dates and their claimable time; show a success message after saving.","A pending scheduled release can be cancelled; a claimed release remains visible with cancellation unavailable and the message “This release has already been claimed.”"]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Claim this space"],"columns":[],"fields":[],"headings":["Released Spaces for Today"],"title":"2 spaces free","ui":[]},"file":"src/pages/employee/AvailableSpaces.tsx","frames":["ST-5","ST-6"],"id":"S-5","reqs":["REQ-6","REQ-11","REQ-12","REQ-13"],"route":"/parking/available","size":"new","states":["Show an empty state with the current available count when there are no released spaces to claim.","After the earliest accepted claim, show the assigned floor and space and state “This claim can’t be cancelled.”","If another employee’s claim is accepted first, remove that space from the list and say it is no longer available."]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Edit plate","Discard","Save vehicle"],"columns":[],"fields":["License plate number *","Vehicle nickname or model (optional)"],"headings":["Your vehicles","Registered vehicle","Register or update license plate"],"title":"Your vehicles","ui":[[3,"form of 2 fields (field validation)"]]},"file":"src/pages/employee/Vehicles.tsx","frames":["ST-7"],"id":"S-6","reqs":["REQ-2","REQ-3","REQ-6"],"route":"/account/vehicles","size":"new","states":["No registered vehicle: explain that at least one plate is required before releasing or claiming parking; keep parking operations blocked until a plate is saved.","Invalid or missing plate: show a clear inline validation message.","Vehicle saved: show the registered plate and a short success message."]},{"facts":{"buttons":[],"columns":[],"fields":[],"headings":["Active Worklist & Evaluation Monitor","Two claimable spaces in shared pool","Next weekly report generation","Latest boom barrier entry check","Administrator modules"],"title":"Active Worklist & Evaluation Monitor","ui":[]},"file":"src/pages/admin/Overview.tsx","frames":["ST-8"],"id":"S-7","reqs":["REQ-6"],"route":"/admin","size":"new","states":[]},{"facts":{"buttons":["View employee"],"columns":["Select","Name","Department","Role","Parking Assignment","Floor","Registered Plate","Action"],"fields":[],"headings":["Employees"],"title":"Employees","ui":[[4,"form of 3 fields (dropdown)"],[1,"search and filters"],[2,"1 table"]]},"file":"src/pages/admin/Employees.tsx","frames":["ST-9"],"id":"S-8","reqs":["REQ-4","REQ-6"],"route":"/admin/employees","size":"new","states":[]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Reset changes","Save parking details"],"columns":[],"fields":["Dedicated Stall Assignment *","Assigned Level / Floor *","Registered Vehicle Plate *","Vehicle Type / Classification","Administrative Notes"],"headings":["Ananya Rao","Parking Allocation & ANPR Clearance"],"title":"Ananya Rao","ui":[[7,"form of 6 fields (dropdown, multi-choice, field validation)"]]},"file":"src/pages/admin/EmployeeDetails.tsx","frames":["ST-10"],"id":"S-9","reqs":["REQ-4","REQ-6"],"route":"/admin/employees/:employeeId","size":"new","states":[]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Mon Active","Tue Active","Wed Active","Thu Active","Fri Active","Sat Off","Sun Off","Discard changes","Save parking setup"],"columns":[],"fields":["Daily Cutoff Execution Time"],"headings":["Parking setup"],"title":"Parking setup","ui":[[4,"form of 4 fields (dropdown)"]]},"file":"src/pages/admin/ParkingSetup.tsx","frames"